<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Réponse à votre message</title>
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: light; }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { body { background: #f0f4f8 !important; } }
    body { margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f0f4f8; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; }
    .container { max-width:560px; margin:0 auto; padding:40px 16px; }
    .card { background:#ffffff; border-radius:12px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; overflow:hidden; }
    .header { background:#e8f0fe; padding:24px 32px; border-bottom:1px solid #d5e2f5; }
    .header h1 { margin:0; color:#1a3a5c; font-size:20px; font-weight:700; }
    .header span { display:block; color:#4a7a9c; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; margin-top:4px; }
    .body { padding:32px 32px 24px; }
    .body p { margin:0 0 16px; line-height:1.6; color:#2c4058; font-size:15px; }
    .body .reply-box { background:#f8fafc; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid #eef2f6; padding:16px 18px; margin:0 0 20px; }
    .body .reply-box .content { font-size:14px; color:#1a3a5c; margin:0; white-space:pre-wrap; line-height:1.6; }
    .body .original-box { background:#f8fafc; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid #eef2f6; padding:16px 18px; margin:0 0 20px; }
    .body .original-box .label { font-size:13px; color:#4a7a9c; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 8px; }
    .body .original-box .content { font-size:14px; color:#6a8ba5; margin:0; font-style:italic; line-height:1.6; }
    .body .signature { font-size:13px; color:#6a8ba5; margin:0; }
    .footer { padding:16px 32px; background:#f8fafc; border-top:1px solid #eef2f6; text-align:center; font-size:11px; color:#9ab0c8; line-height:1.5; }
    .footer .copy { margin:6px 0 0; color:#b5c8da; }
    @media (max-width:600px) {
      .header, .body, .footer { padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#f0f4f8; padding:40px 16px;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:560px; background:#ffffff; border-radius:12px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; overflow:hidden;">
          <tr>
            <td style="background:#e8f0fe; padding:24px 32px; border-bottom:1px solid #d5e2f5;">
              <span style="color:#1a3a5c; font-size:20px; font-weight:700;">Paname Consulting</span>
              <span style="display:block; color:#4a7a9c; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; margin-top:4px;">Réponse à votre message</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:32px 32px 24px;">
              <p style="font-size:15px; color:#1a3a5c; margin:0 0 6px; font-weight:600;">
                Bonjour{{#if name}} {{name}}{{/if}},
              </p>
              <p style="font-size:14px; color:#2c4058; margin:0 0 20px; line-height:1.6;">
                Une réponse a été apportée à votre message :
              </p>

              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f8fafc; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid #eef2f6; margin:0 0 20px;">
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:16px 18px;">
                    <p style="font-size:14px; color:#1a3a5c; margin:0; white-space:pre-wrap; line-height:1.6;">{{reply}}</p>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <p style="font-size:13px; color:#6a8ba5; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 12px; font-weight:500;">Votre message initial :</p>
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f8fafc; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid #eef2f6; margin:0 0 20px;">
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:16px 18px;">
                    <p style="font-size:14px; color:#6a8ba5; margin:0; font-style:italic; line-height:1.6;">{{message}}</p>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <p style="font-size:13px; color:#6a8ba5; line-height:1.6; margin:0;">
                Cordialement,<br />L'équipe Paname Consulting
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:16px 32px; background:#f8fafc; border-top:1px solid #eef2f6; text-align:center; font-size:11px; color:#9ab0c8; line-height:1.5;">
              <p style="margin:0;">Ceci est un message automatique, merci de ne pas y répondre directement.</p>
              <p style="margin:6px 0 0; color:#b5c8da;">&copy; {{year}} Paname Consulting</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>